# Trivy ignore file.
#
# One CVE per line. Always pair an entry with a comment explaining WHY this
# CVE doesn't apply to Steward's runtime -- "wait for upstream patch" with no
# detail is what lets stale ignores rot in place.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYYY  # reason / re-evaluate after <date>
#
# (Empty on purpose; add entries here only when a Trivy failure is shown to
#  be a false-positive or non-exploitable in Steward's actual configuration.)
